                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "adverbial",
                            "participle",
                            "present"
                        ],
                        "form": "бере́менея"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f66f2585-3461-4161-a877-3ad5da6bbb7b",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "adverbial",
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "бере́менев"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d6cd858c-f10f-4417-a7e1-2622d28a27c5",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "adverbial",
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "бере́меневши"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "2879d2e7-a5ff-4504-8c5e-7234b21a83da",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "future"
                        ],
                        "form": "буду/будешь… бере́менеть"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f026c236-ea1f-3720-b6b9-5648096f6e26",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "становиться беременной"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33d9a16b-9ce8-4f9b-994f-f898556440c7",
                                "sense_id": "f026c236-ea1f-3720-b6b9-5648096f6e26",
                                "text": "Знаешь, в Бразилии девочки иногда беременеют лет в шесть."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b907911-f5d2-486f-adc4-29ca2180a7a9",
                                "sense_id": "f026c236-ea1f-3720-b6b9-5648096f6e26",
                                "text": "— Ах, да, действительно, — воскликнула Елена грустно-насмешливым голосом, — женщина прежде всего должна думать, что она самка и что первая её обязанность — родить здоровых детей, здоровой грудью кормить их, потом снова беременеть и снова кормить: обязанность приятная, нечего сказать!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9631d977-d2fb-440f-9114-38c24989825c",
                                "sense_id": "f026c236-ea1f-3720-b6b9-5648096f6e26",
                                "text": "Молитвы, многолетние жертвования в мечеть, знахари, заговоры — всё было испробовано Шир-Мамедом. Тщетно, — его жена не беременела."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d97175e-41c4-403d-9fac-9570d1bbfa5e",
                                "sense_id": "f026c236-ea1f-3720-b6b9-5648096f6e26",
                                "text": "Психолог 1. Миф № 4: с первого раза не беременеют. Психолог 2. Это неправда, по статистике, 20% беременностей происходит после первого полового контакта."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f815bf63-342e-3d8d-94a5-75009da03a84",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "становиться стельной, жерёбой (о корове, лошади)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "06af59f9-0476-4561-86c3-49554db7fccb",
                                "sense_id": "f815bf63-342e-3d8d-94a5-75009da03a84",
                                "text": "Уже через 6—18 дней после того, как кобыла даёт потомство, её выводят на спаривание, и она опять беременеет."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02dd8779-1ee9-3de8-84cf-e7a133e6529a",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. производить имплантацию зародыша, обеспечивать рост и развитие плода"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b92e4a7b-07a3-4b05-a011-7bbe22825f9c",
                                "sense_id": "02dd8779-1ee9-3de8-84cf-e7a133e6529a",
                                "text": "В других случаях может наблюдаться наличие двух маток и двух влагалищ 〈…〉 однако каждая матка, если она достаточно развита, может функционировать самостоятельно (менструировать и беременеть)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9c01673-581e-3dc2-849e-bf73444f8ccb",
                        "entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. становиться пузатым"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9729729a-078d-4e0a-b50c-79ba16a2591b",
                                "sense_id": "e9c01673-581e-3dc2-849e-bf73444f8ccb",
                                "text": "У детей сотни поздравительных открыток с сердцами и голубками — открыток, от которых в эти дни беременеют все почтальоны Нью-Йорка и которые являются единственным предметом широкого потребления всех универсальных магазинов во все предпраздничные дни."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4132be2-f919-47cb-a109-a4a7abc8a614",
                        "source_entry_id": "8969cd82-bd08-366e-a3cb-1c1891e147b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "pregnant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pregnant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec16d19a-ce97-3293-bc9a-8bc61f9370b1",
                                        "entry_id": "15c44e5a-1432-3dd2-9711-3a0df20a8656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Carrying developing offspring within the body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba398037-f5f0-497e-b8dd-dccbf274b345",
                                                "sense_id": "ec16d19a-ce97-3293-bc9a-8bc61f9370b1",
                                                "text": "I went to the doctor and, guess what, I’m five weeks pregnant!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61133990-5235-4c3d-b8ea-82d55720642c",
                                                "sense_id": "ec16d19a-ce97-3293-bc9a-8bc61f9370b1",
                                                "text": "I became pregnant in July 2014."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f90a95f6-36d4-4b28-8455-a185eeb190ba",
                                                "sense_id": "ec16d19a-ce97-3293-bc9a-8bc61f9370b1",
                                                "text": "Once upon a time, not so long ago, women got pregnant and spent nine months in suspense before finding out if they were having a boy or a girl. But today? That waiting game is completely outdated, even quaint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91ba5e96-66e7-4328-b3e5-ecc11ed011f1",
                                                "sense_id": "ec16d19a-ce97-3293-bc9a-8bc61f9370b1",
                                                "text": "It suggests that pregnant women should be called pregnant people, presumably on the basis that just perhaps there may be a pregnant man somewhere."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a998b2cc-5da3-3aa9-9b58-8e9ddf824ee3",
                                        "entry_id": "15c44e5a-1432-3dd2-9711-3a0df20a8656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Carrying developing offspring within the body.",
                                            "Of a couple: expecting a baby together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "proscribed",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38a4829f-0d4f-4a91-9a98-2f5a2d1360bb",
                                                "sense_id": "a998b2cc-5da3-3aa9-9b58-8e9ddf824ee3",
                                                "text": "We are pregnant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66c3696b-3f54-335f-83ca-4d5303c73207",
                                        "entry_id": "15c44e5a-1432-3dd2-9711-3a0df20a8656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Meaningful, having numerous possibilities or implications; full of promise; abounding in ability, resources, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "213d0848-f590-4de7-a4fe-7e89f0754a22",
                                                "sense_id": "66c3696b-3f54-335f-83ca-4d5303c73207",
                                                "text": "a pregnant pause"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a25c6714-be02-49b1-be58-8e3162a22197",
                                                "sense_id": "66c3696b-3f54-335f-83ca-4d5303c73207",
                                                "text": "wherein the pregnant enemy does much"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8407ea8-d27d-4ac7-b78f-de1bfe9381e0",
                                                "sense_id": "66c3696b-3f54-335f-83ca-4d5303c73207",
                                                "text": "The many tear-jerkers deal with finality, with death and the end of love, with a stoicism pregnant with feeling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c564c1d5-65e0-3dcd-acf0-f9f22d71b6da",
                                        "entry_id": "15c44e5a-1432-3dd2-9711-3a0df20a8656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fecund, fertile, prolific (usually of soil, ground, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cec7016a-328f-4819-b668-11718006d562",
                                                "sense_id": "c564c1d5-65e0-3dcd-acf0-f9f22d71b6da",
                                                "text": "The sunne-beames bright vpon her body playd, / Being through former bathing mollifide, / And pierst into her wombe, where they embayd / With so sweet sence and secret power vnspide, / That in her pregnant flesh they shortly fructifide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9030f21f-9ca5-3e5d-b6a8-cfc8157f842b",
                                        "entry_id": "15c44e5a-1432-3dd2-9711-3a0df20a8656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Affording entrance; receptive; yielding; willing; open; prompt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cbdc1c9-fd9d-472d-8d2f-0722663c738d",
                                                "sense_id": "9030f21f-9ca5-3e5d-b6a8-cfc8157f842b",
                                                "text": "play at subtill games; faire vertues all;\nTo which the Grecians are most prompt and pregnant"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3617dd41-01f7-3d19-88b5-7ff596bcf1fd",
                                        "entry_id": "15c44e5a-1432-3dd2-9711-3a0df20a8656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ready-witted; clever; ingenious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pregnant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87487b98-7382-3904-b942-20401ebf26a4",
                                        "entry_id": "2df66fb0-79ba-3081-98ec-318d88776c4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pregnant person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c494c812-c746-43a3-b0bf-cbeb36da418c",
                                                "sense_id": "87487b98-7382-3904-b942-20401ebf26a4",
                                                "text": "The Entbundenen, or those already delivered, are separate from those pregnants awaiting their accouchement"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pregnant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63a8cbb0-7841-3cc9-ae70-664576c12e54",
                                        "entry_id": "ed2c3583-f2d7-328f-b46e-2a840536a0dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Compelling; clear, evident."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc71dcf3-cffe-42ed-b1a1-eb5a8e27b42c",
                                                "sense_id": "63a8cbb0-7841-3cc9-ae70-664576c12e54",
                                                "text": "Peregrine was in a little time a distinguished character, not only for his acuteness of apprehension, but also for that mischievous fertility of fancy, of which we have already given such pregnant examples."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
